msgid ""
"The keybinding that runs the correspondingly-numbered command in "
"/apps/marco/keybinding_commands The format looks like \"<Control>a\" or "
"\"<Shift><Alt>F1\". The parser is fairly liberal and allows lower or upper "
"case, and also abbreviations such as \"<Ctl>\" and \"<Ctrl>\". If you set "
"the option to the special string \"disabled\", then there will be no "
"keybinding for this action."
msgstr ""
"Taustiņu sasaiste, kas palaiž atbilstoši numurēto komandu no /apps/marco/"
"keybinding_commands. Formāts ir, piemēram, \"<Control>a\" vai \"<Shift><Alt>"
"F1\". Parsētājs ir diezgan pielaidīgs un pieļauj gan mazos, gan lielos "
"burtus, kā arī saīsinājumus, piemēram, \"<Ctl>\" un \"<Ctrl>\". Ja opcijai "
"iestatāt īpašo virkni \"disabled\", šai darbībai taustiņu sasaistes nebūs."

